vidence. Every failure brings you closer to perfection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405120/extras/65d479efce8a554b428709b35a02665a.poster.avif?t=1750925960\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405120/extras/65d479efce8a554b428709b35a02665a.webm?t=1750925960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405120/extras/65d479efce8a554b428709b35a02665a.mp4?t=1750925960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AMAZING LOCATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level brings a fresh challenge:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apartment:</strong> Find clever hiding spots in a familiar setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Museum:</strong> Conceal the body among art and exhibits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spaceship:</strong> Master zero-gravity chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sunken Ship:</strong> Submerge evidence and manipulate time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405120/extras/8dd1a0aeaf22b119683873e57eeb8536.poster.avif?t=1750925960\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405120/extras/8dd1a0aeaf22b119683873e57eeb8536.webm?t=1750925960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405120/extras/8dd1a0aeaf22b119683873e57eeb8536.mp4?t=1750925960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE IT YOUR STYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn points by hiding evidence and erasing fingerprints, then spend them to unlock quirky skins like Zombie, Superhero, Disco, and more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DON\u2019T FORGET:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have 4 minutes, 6 hiding spots, and a ticking clock before the cops arrive. Can you pull it off in time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready for epic chaos. And remember: time waits for no one!</strong> \ud83d\udea8</p>",
